0 MOMENTUM TWINS — steer a free platform with internal reaction torque
0 Name: momentum-twins.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/momentum-twins.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; two medium angular motors on ports A and B.
0 // Standard seated turntable bearing; no geared yaw drive or hidden constraints.
0 // Rotor bars and four wheel weights are balanced about their own motor axes.
0 // Motor cradle strategy adapted from the corrected Quickstroke / Pantograph mounts.
